            { stage: "Stage 3 (Hybrid Turbo)", power: "240 - 250+ hp", notes: "Requires swapping the factory turbo for a larger hybrid unit, and a 4-bar MAP sensor. The EA288 bottom end handles this beautifully, turning the 136hp A4 into a highly capable sleeper.", zeroToHundred: "6.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "18.0s" } 
